<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts MoneyGram.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts MoneyGram.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman said it initiated coverage of MoneyGram Payment Systems Inc with a buy rating and one-year price target of $18.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said it expected the company to see 15 to 20 percent growth both on the top-line and in terms of earnings per share over the next three years.</p>
<p>-- The company went public in December 1996. The stock was trading at 13, up 1/4, at mid-morning Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau, 212-859-1736))</p>
</text>
